00:57:43.080 --> 00:57:46.040
n't reach Nirvana. They fell into the realms of hell.

00:57:47.080 --> 00:57:49.080
But they burned away their negative karma

00:57:50.040 --> 00:57:55.560
and became human again after many millions of years.

00:57:57.840 --> 00:58:03.560
Somewhere deep inside them, this teaching that Manjushri gave them about bodhichitta remained, and they remembered it. They

00:58:04.240 --> 00:58:07.680
became bodhisattvas and became Buddhas.

00:58:08.600 --> 00:58:10.600
That would take less time than

00:58:12.320 --> 00:58:16.320
reaching a lower nirvana without studying bodhichitta.

00:58:16.800 --> 00:58:20.800
It would be faster to go to hell

00:58:20.800 --> 00:58:22.440
