00:58:25.960 --> 00:58:27.880
than if you didn't use bodhichitta

00:58:27.880 --> 00:58:29.960
and went to a lower nirvana.

00:58:32.520 --> 00:58:37.120
This is a picture of someone intentionally sending someone else down the wrong road.

