00:59:49.400 --> 00:59:54.480
In this case, we're not talking about breathing meditation. We're talking about the

00:59:54.640 --> 00:59:59.840
fact that it's good to follow the three main paths in order.

01:00:01.080 --> 01:00:03.080
To be sad about this world.

01:00:05.960 --> 01:00:09.120
To strive to have that bodhichitta experience directly.

01:00:09.800 --> 01:00:12.680
To perceive emptiness so that you can help everyone.

01:00:13.160 --> 01:00:18.880
Warm up first with feelings of sadness about  this life.

01:00:19.000 --> 01:00:21.440
Next picture.

